  <name>Emberfall / Guardian / boulder breaks into six pieces</name>
  <desc>Original native Krita cutouts. Assembled boulder at terrain contact, six independent arcs, spin, staggered ground contacts, small secondary bounces, settling and fade. Ground anchors and rotational clearance prevent floating or sinking fragments. 72 frames at 60 Hz.</desc>
